        "created_at": "2016-06-18T07:30:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Specifically, <font face=\"courier\">fonts.</font><br>\n1:  <font face=\"redstatebluestate bb\">Is this text written in the font used in Sotm card text?</font><br>\n2:  <font face=\"enochian\">Can you even read this?</font></p>\n<p>What does this look like to other people? These are both non-standard fonts I got through downloads; RedStateBlueState BB and Enochian. They show up on my screen just fine, but I want to know whether that’s only because they’re fonts I have on my computer.</p>\n<p>Actually, I might as well do one more experiment and see what happens if I <font face=\"Alien Dude\">use I non-standard font I DON’T have.</font></p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:47:40.810Z",
